WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.728
Around 1041 the Byzantine Empire came
to claim Ani, the Bagratid capital.

2
00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:12.958
The sparapet Vahram Pahlavuni
led the Armenians out

3
00:00:12.998 --> 00:00:15.545
and routed an imperial army.

4
00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:19.298
No Byzantine army
ever took Ani by storm.

5
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:24.728
But in 1045, while its young king
was kept in Constantinople,

6
00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:26.839
the city was handed over.

7
00:00:27.079 --> 00:00:29.790
Keep the young king's crown.

